sentences.text:
The petitioner/accused No.1 is directed to be enlarged on bail in Crime No.52/2023 registered by Mangalore Women Police, Mangaluru City for the offences punishable under Sections 417, 376, 506 of IPC, subject to the following conditions:
a) The petitioner shall execute personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/-
(Rupees One lakhs only) with one surety for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;
 NC: 2023:KHC:33852  c) The petitioner shall not directly or  indirectly threaten or tamper with the  prosecution witnesses;
 d) The petitioner shall not leave the  jurisdiction of the Trial Court without Aneesh Rahaman vs The State Of Karnataka on 19 September, 2023

